WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.490
- So, wait, we just had the Oscars Sunday.

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:03.600
- Yeah, I know.
- So you didn't go,

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.140
I know, I heard, but
like, did you watch it?

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:06.973
What your favorite moment?

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.640
I did watch it, I was in a
restaurant actually watching it.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.146
They had it up on the
thing, so that was great

00:00:11.146 --> 00:00:11.979
to watch that.
- Yeah.

00:00:11.979 --> 00:00:13.590
Anything happen that you love?

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.472
- I cried when Brendan
Fraser got the award.

00:00:15.472 --> 00:00:18.289
- Oh, it's so cool.
- I cried.

00:00:18.289 --> 00:00:19.274
- He did such an incredible job.

00:00:19.274 --> 00:00:20.107
(audience applauding)

00:00:20.107 --> 00:00:21.400
- Yeah, I worked with Brendan, you know,

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.240
quite a few years ago on
a film called Inkheart

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.750
and he is such a lovely person.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.890
I think you've had him on your show.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.180
- Yeah, yeah, I've him a couple times.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:31.013
We love him, yeah.

00:00:31.013 --> 00:00:34.020
- I'm sure you, you know
what a beautiful man he is.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:36.840
He's a magical man, I think.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.970
And he was clearly very, very moved.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.190
It was a huge moment for him.

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:44.160
So, it was the right person for me.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.220
The way he responded to it,
I just found it very moving.

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.680
It was the highlight for
me of the whole show.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.510
- I love that when you're
rooting for someone

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.040
'cause you really believe
in like what they're-

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.200
either them, or their
project, whatever it may be,

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.033
and then they win.

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:56.963
That's a really good feeling
for everyone involved.

00:00:56.963 --> 00:00:58.230
- Yeah, it's great.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.230
It's great.
- Yeah.

